Indeed tcp_prune_ofo_queue() is reusing the skb dropped a few lines
above. The caller wants to enqueue 'in_skb', lets check space vs the
latter.

Fixes: 1d2fbaad7cd8 ("tcp: stronger sk_rcvbuf checks")
